<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Lynn Public Schools — Chronic Absenteeism Dashboard</title>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.5.1"></script>
<style>
:root{
  --navy:#1F3D5C; --teal:#2E9B9B; --orange:#D98A3D; --green:#4E9D6B; --coral:#D26161;
  --purple:#8C7BB8; --ltblue:#7FB1D6; --grid:#E4E8EC; --muted:#8A949E; --txt:#2B2B2B;
  --bg:#F4F6F8; --card:#FFFFFF; --radius:10px; --gap:16px;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Calibri,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--txt);line-height:1.5}
.wrap{max-width:1400px;margin:0 auto;padding:var(--gap)}
header.top{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:20px 24px;border-radius:var(--radius);margin-bottom:var(--gap)}
header.top h1{font-size:22px;font-weight:700}
header.top p{font-size:13px;color:#BBD3E0;margin-top:2px}
.filters{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px}
.fg{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}
.fg label{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:#9DB6CC}
.fg select{padding:7px 12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);border-radius:6px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);color:#fff;font-size:13px;min-width:180px}
.fg select option{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}
.kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:var(--gap);margin-bottom:var(--gap)}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}
.brand img.logo{height:54px;width:auto;flex:none}
.kpi{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:18px 20px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.07);border-left:4px solid var(--navy)}
.kpi .lab{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.kpi .val{font-size:30px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-top:4px}
.kpi .sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
.kpi .sub.up{color:var(--coral);font-weight:600}
.kpi .sub.down{color:var(--green);font-weight:600}
.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:var(--gap);margin-bottom:var(--gap)}
.card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:18px 22px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.07)}
.card h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy)}
.card .csub{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px}
.chart-box{position:relative;height:340px}
.full{grid-column:1/-1}
.heatwrap{overflow-x:auto}
table.heat{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:12px}
table.heat th{font-size:11px;color:var(--navy);font-weight:700;padding:6px 4px;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom}
table.heat th.sch{text-align:left;width:210px}
table.heat th .da{display:block;font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:400;font-style:italic}
table.heat td{padding:0;text-align:center;border:2px solid #fff;height:26px;font-size:11px;color:#222}
table.heat td.sch{text-align:right;padding-right:10px;color:var(--txt);font-weight:500;background:#fff;border:none;white-space:nowrap}
.arrow.dn{color:#2E7D52;font-weight:700}
.arrow.up{color:#C0392B;font-weight:700}
.arrow.fl{color:var(--muted)}
table.data{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:13px}
table.data thead th{text-align:left;padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:2px solid #dee2e6;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;white-space:nowrap}
table.data thead th:hover{color:var(--navy)}
table.data td{padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0}
table.data tbody tr:hover{background:#f8f9fa}
.legend{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;font-size:11px;color:var(--txt);margin-bottom:10px}
.legend .sw{display:inline-block;width:14px;height:14px;border:1px solid #fff;border-radius:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:4px}
.pill{display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600}
footer{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);font-style:italic;padding:8px 4px 20px}
@media(max-width:900px){.row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.kpis{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
<header class="top">
  <div class="brand">
    <img class="logo" src="https://croninm-lynn.github.io/lps-enrollment-dashboard/lps-logo.png" alt="Lynn Public Schools logo">
    <div>
      <h1>Lynn Public Schools — Chronic Absenteeism</h1>
      <p>Three-year district review, 2022–23 through 2024–25 · % of students missing 10%+ of enrolled days</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="filters">
    <div class="fg"><label>Student group</label><select id="fGroup"></select></div>
    <div class="fg"><label>School level</label><select id="fLevel">
      <option value="All">All levels</option><option value="Elementary">Elementary</option>
      <option value="Middle">Middle</option><option value="High">High</option></select></div>
    <div class="fg"><label>School year</label><select id="fYear">
      <option value="all">All years (compare)</option>
      <option value="0">2022–23</option><option value="1">2023–24</option><option value="2" selected>2024–25</option></select></div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="kpis" id="kpis"></section>

<section class="row">
  <div class="card">
    <h3 id="trendTitle">District &amp; level trend</h3>
    <div class="csub" id="trendSub"></div>
    <div class="chart-box"><canvas id="trendChart"></canvas></div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3 id="barTitle">Chronic absenteeism by school</h3>
    <div class="csub" id="barSub"></div>
    <div class="chart-box"><canvas id="barChart"></canvas></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="card full" style="margin-bottom:var(--gap)">
  <h3>Heat map — school × student group</h3>
  <div class="csub" id="heatSub"></div>
  <div class="legend" id="heatLegend"></div>
  <div class="heatwrap"><table class="heat" id="heatTable"></table></div>
</section>

<section class="card full">
  <h3 id="tblTitle">School detail</h3>
  <div class="csub">Click a column header to sort.</div>
  <div style="overflow-x:auto"><table class="data" id="dataTable"></table></div>
</section>

<footer>Source: Lynn Public Schools attendance data (MA DESE). District totals are official enrollment-weighted figures; school-level values from the school file. Level-average trend lines are the mean of school rates within each level.</footer>
</div>

